@InventoryReorderPlatform.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7025

### Get all inventory items
GET {{InventoryReorderPlatform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventoryitems
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new inventory item
POST {{InventoryReorderPlatform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventoryitems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "USB-C Docking Station",
  "sku": "DOCK-1001",
  "quantityOnHand": 12,
  "reorderThreshold": 5,
  "status": "Active"
}

###

### Get inventory item by id
GET {{InventoryReorderPlatform.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventoryitems/1
Accept: application/json
